data: {"answer": "這裡是「隱私小教堂」（導覽稱湖畔教堂），牆上的彩繪玻璃講的是個資保護原則。重點有三點：個資只用在當初目的、保持正確、保管好，時間到了就刪除。看得到的防護措施包括資料分級與處理規則、資料最小化與保存期限。相關流程涵蓋客人要求查詢、更正或刪除個資。你可以走到港口廣場・供應商，或靠近教堂看個資原則。", "go": [], "followups": [{"text": "接下來要去哪？", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "zh", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 9.78, "total_s": 9.8}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "church_in", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "church_in"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 6.6}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "church_in", "label": "Room", "en": "Lakeside Chapel", "zh": "湖畔教堂"}, {"key": "data_classification", "label": "Control", "en": "Data Classification & Handling", "zh": "資料分級與處理規則"}, {"key": "retention_deletion", "label": "Control", "en": "Data Minimization & Retention Schedule", "zh": "資料最小化與保存期限"}, {"key": "c_data_lifecycle", "label": "Concept", "en": "Data Lifecycle", "zh": "資料生命週期"}, {"key": "c_privacy_principles", "label": "Concept", "en": "Privacy Principles", "zh": "個資保護原則"}, {"key": "c_personal_data", "label": "Concept", "en": "Personal Data", "zh": "個人資料"}], "edges": [{"a": "c_personal_data", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "church_in"}, {"a": "c_privacy_principles", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "church_in"}, {"a": "c_privacy_principles", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "retention_deletion"}, {"a": "c_data_lifecycle", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "church_in"}, {"a": "c_data_lifecycle", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "retention_deletion"}, {"a": "c_data_lifecycle", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "data_classification"}, {"a": "data_classification", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "church_in"}, {"a": "retention_deletion", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "church_in"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "房間：隱私小教堂（導覽裡的名稱：湖畔教堂）\n這裡講的是：彩繪玻璃畫的是個資保護的原則。\n重點：個資只用在當初的目的、保持正確、保管好、時間到就刪。\n看得到的防護措施：資料分級與處理規則、資料最小化與保存期限\n課程概念：資料生命週期、個資保護原則、個人資料\n相關的處理流程：客人要求查詢、更正或刪除個資\n可以走到：港口廣場・供應商、教堂近看・個資原則", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 9.77, "load_s": 0.01, "prompt_tokens": 643, "prompt_s": 2.46, "gen_tokens": 94, "gen_s": 7.29, "tok_per_s": 12.9, "first_token_s": 2.48}}, "state": {}}

